  "description": "Tania can mark a moment in time and return to it whenever she wants. But that power can't ease the grief of losing Mr. Aiden, the man who raised her like a daughter. Determined to save him, she returns to when she was 7 years old, a painful period she would never relive if he weren't still alive. With knowledge of the future and endless retries, she begins rewriting her life. But when her attempts to change the future create new complications, can Tania still save the man she came back for? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
